#: templates/email/project_inactive.html:18
msgid ""
"Responde a este correo y lo vemos contigo: difusión, revisar el formulario, "
"un QR para recoger datos sin necesidad de cuenta, o lo que haga falta."
msgstr ""
"Reply to this email and we will look at it with you: outreach, reviewing the "
"form, a QR code to collect data without an account, or whatever is needed."

#: templates/email/project_inactive.html:21
msgid ""
"Y si el proyecto ya ha cumplido su ciclo, puedes marcarlo como terminado "
"desde su página de edición. Los datos se conservan y deja de aparecer como "
"activo."
msgstr ""
"And if the project has run its course, you can mark it as ended from its "
"edit page. The data is kept and it stops showing as active."

#: templates/email/project_inactive.html:28
msgid "Ir al proyecto"
msgstr "Go to the project"

#: templates/email/project_inactive.html:32
msgid ""
"Si prefieres no recibir este resumen, puedes desactivarlo en los ajustes del "
"proyecto."
msgstr ""
"If you would rather not receive this summary, you can turn it off in the "
"project settings."

#: templates/email/project_inactive.html:38
#, python-format
msgid "Puedes responder a este correo: llega a %(contact_email)s."
msgstr "You can reply to this email: it reaches %(contact_email)s."

#: templates/email/project_invitation.html:8
msgid "Te han invitado a un proyecto"
msgstr "You have been invited to a project"

#: templates/email/project_invitation.html:11
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"      <strong>%(inviter)s</strong> te ha invitado a unirte al proyecto "
"<strong>%(name)s</strong> como administrador.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"      <strong>%(inviter)s</strong> has invited you to join the project "
"<strong>%(name)s</strong> as an administrator.\n"
"    "
